c-v5-its.c::gicv5_its_l2sz_to_l2_bits","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::gicv5_its_init_devtab"],"text":"IRS derives width from bounds, chooses flat or hier. Granule prefers native then degrades. Linear shrinks over limit; two-level records geometry. ITS abandons if span exceeds width."},{"sids":["drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::ITS_FLAGS_NON_COHERENT","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::gicv5_its_alloc_devtab_linear","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::gicv5_its_dcache_clean","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::its_writeq_relaxed","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::gicv5_its_alloc_devtab_two_level","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::devtab_cfgr_field","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::its_write_table_entry","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::gicv5_its_devtab_get_dte_ref","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::gicv5_its_alloc_l2_devtab","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::gicv5_its_device_get_itte_ref","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::gicv5_its_init_domain","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::gicv5_its_print_info","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::gicv5_its_deinit_devtab"],"text":"Flat shrinks over ceiling. Hier splits width, caps upper. Non-coherent cleans, coherent barriers. Lookup direct flat, split hier with on-demand lower. Domain hierarchical; cached word holds shape and width; teardown frees upper."},{"sids":["drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::irs_readl_relaxed","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::irs_writel_relaxed","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::irs_readq_relaxed","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::irs_writeq_relaxed","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::gicv5_irs_ist_synchronise","include/linux/irqchip/arm-gic-v5.h::gicv5_wait_for_op_atomic","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::its_readl_relaxed","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::its_writel_relaxed","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::pr_fmt","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v4.c::gic_domain","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v4.c::vpe_domain_ops","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v4.c::sgi_domain_ops"],"text":"Register via relaxed base-plus-offset; ops poll for idle via atomic wait. Diagnostics prefixed; globals retain main domain plus ops gating generation."}],"locks":[{"sids":["drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::gicv5_spi_irq_set_type","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::gicv5_irs_of_init","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::gicv5_its_init_bases","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-its.c::gicv5_its_chip_data","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::gic_acpi_parse_madt_irs"],"text":"Shared config under per-instance raw spinlock across select-program. Device lifetime under per-controller mutex in chip state."}],"pass":1,"phase_map":[{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p14","crown":"A","phase":"F0"},{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p04","crown":"A","phase":"F1"},{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p04","crown":"A","phase":"F2"},{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p05","crown":"A","phase":"F4"}],"schema":"lx.dossier.v1","state_machines":[{"sids":["drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v4.c::its_make_vpe_resident","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v4.c::its_make_vpe_non_resident","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v4.c::its_commit_vpe","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v4.c::its_invall_vpe","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v4.c::its_send_vpe_cmd"],"text":"Element resident and ready via schedule, deschedule, commit and invalidate; newer carries enable and doorbell, older masks host. Markers after success. Callers non-preemptible."},{"sids":["drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::gicv5_irs_of_init","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::gicv5_irs_init_bases","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::gicv5_irs_of_init_affinity","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::gicv5_irs_init","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::gicv5_irs_remove","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::gicv5_irs_clear_affinity","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::gicv5_irs_disable","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5.c::gicv5_free_lpi_domain","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5.c::gicv5_deinit_lpis","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::gic_acpi_parse_iaffid","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs.c::gicv5_irs_acpi_init_affinity","drivers/irqchip/irq-gic-v5-irs